{
    "pageid": 1963,
    "title": "Patch 1.111",
    "sections": [
        {
            "heading": "Introduction",
            "level": 1,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Patch 1.111 was released on August 16, 2013 [1] ."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "It is a hotfix that intends to fix all major outstanding issues, including broken Patch 1.103 save games."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "It is the last patch of the 1.0 branch. It can still be downloaded from Steam after Patch 2.0 , via opting in for Beta branches."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Major",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Fixed the delayed event bloating of save files.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Pre 1.11 save games will now load correctly without trait corruption",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Fixed CTD when a Portrait DLC did not have a beard for the culture",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Fixed CTD when immediately resigning after loaded save game with pending plots",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Interface",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Fixed a glitch after resign where the on-map shields would still be shown",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Fixed so you don't get a pop-up if the plot auto functions are used",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Disabled customization of dynasties without the DLC",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Gameplay",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Fixed a bug where vassal merchant republics could sometimes become independent on succession",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "The Military Jesus and Speaking in Tongues modifiers are no longer instantly removed from characters",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Fixed an issue where you could suffer more than Max attrition",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Now possible to pick the Hellenic religion in the Ruler Designer again",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Can now correctly grant independence to Merchant republics",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Can now correctly transfer vassal Merchant republics",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Character beards and hair now don't immediately snap back when using the customization tool",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Fixed an issue with new Patricians sometimes getting game over incorrectly on succession",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Converter",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Fixed issues with exporting HRE with absolute crown authority .",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Now young rulers get appropriate stats",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Now players should always be exported as a vassal if he is in CK2",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Fixed problem where Muslim personal unions were not exported at all",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "The Azores and Madeira can now be colonized",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Now localization files on Linux always get UTF-8 encoding",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Changed some file names in conversion table for nations",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Fixed so Tengri can get higher tech groups",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Tweaked what is considered high-tech to increase chance of becoming western",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Now natives no longer should spawn in Africa",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "References",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
